    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋigolei ŋiarei ka ekitoe a epiini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lokoku a ituŋanan, tolimu ibore ŋini emaikina totedoroe, ido tolimok Ŋisirael akitadapet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema iyoŋ neni kec, ‘Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kiŋit ŋituŋa ŋulu akaŋerito ayoŋ lu ŋakiro nu ebe, ‘Nyiyenete iyes apolou atediet a ŋin ka akitadapet ŋin a?’ Tolimok ikes ebe, ‘Abu erwosit a Babilon bu Yerusalem, ya erwosit alo Yerusalem ka ŋulu epukatotor erwosit, toriko ikes torukosi ka iŋes Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit a Babilon ŋol ya eyenet a erwosit alo Yerusalem epei, tocamunos ka iŋes ka kisikoŋ iŋes akiwuap ŋakiro keŋ, (aris erwosit a Babilon apaki ŋin keriko ŋikapolok a akwap a Yerusalem), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere edaun agogoŋu eyakatar ŋituŋa ŋulu ka apukan a Yerusalem ka edaun epite ŋolo egogoŋunioto nabo, amaikina ikes kiboyoto iwuapito acamunet keŋ ka eyenet a erwosit a Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu eyenet a erwosit a Yerusalem ŋol toŋer ŋakiro a erwosit a Babilon, kiyakiya ŋikawoikinitok keŋ nakwap a Ijipit erae kepedorete ikes ainakin iŋes ŋaŋolei ka ŋasigarya ŋuna alalak.’ Abu Akuj tema, ‘Epedori mono kire iŋes akiloun a? Epedori mono kire ituŋanan ŋini itiyae ŋakiro ŋuna ikote ŋun abucar a? Nyemaikina iŋes toŋer ŋakiro ŋuna aris kecamunoi, ido kimyekinae nyisicani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimu Ekapolon Akuj ebe, ‘Ikwapei kire ayarya ayoŋ, etwanikini iŋes Babilon, nakwap a erwosit a ŋolo abu kituruwor iŋes erwosit ŋolo tokona ajamuwa iŋes akikoŋet ka aŋer daŋ acamunet keŋ ka iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyepedorete Parao ka ŋasigarya keŋ ŋuna alalak ka ŋirukitos keŋ ŋulu alalak akiŋarakin iŋes alojie a ŋolo edukitotor Ŋibabiloniyae ŋakititisyo ka ŋarwatatain aŋuna ka amunyarya ŋikalalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyebucar iŋes aneni a Ŋibabiloniyae, anerae ajamuwa iŋes akikoŋet keŋ ka aŋer acamunet keŋ ka erwosit a Babilon. Nyebucar iŋes, anerae abu kiik akitiya ŋun, nai tokona nyiwuapa iŋes ŋakiro ŋun daadaŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, alimu tokona Ekapolon Akuj ebe, ‘Ikwapei kire ayarya ayoŋ, esicani ayoŋ ekepukan a Yerusalem aŋuna ajamuwarya ŋuna abu kikoŋ neni kaŋ ka aŋuna aŋeryo acamunet kaŋ ka iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariyori ayoŋ atibait kaŋ aŋuna keŋ, ido ekamu iŋes. Ayauni ayoŋ iŋes Babilon, otubok iŋes a nen, anerae abu iŋes toruwor ŋolo pa ekinyoma aneni kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earyo ŋasigarya keŋ daadaŋ apaki ŋina ebwaŋatar, ido ŋuna idoŋete, ielaryo ŋolowae ka akwap daadaŋ. Ŋakiro ŋun nai iyenunia iyoŋ atemar ayoŋ Ekapolon abu erwor ŋakiro ŋun.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aponi kitopolooroe Isirael ekaku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon Akuj kirwor ŋakiro nu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
